            // Spec §5.5 #8/#9. getEarningsStats and getEarningsHistory both build this
            // figure as COALESCE(SUM(rate),0) server-side (escorts.ts:1971, :2674-2676),
            // over a nullable `rate` column (schema.ts:3814). The zero is applied before
            // the wire, so a client CANNOT recover absence here — the only honest move
            // left is to name what the number is made of. It is not the settled figure
            // and it is not the sum of the seats below; those come from netPayout, and
            // the two disagree until every move in the period is paid. The average
            // inherits the same provenance because it is this number over the count.
